{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26023","headline":"窃览都官李郎中和李舍人益酬张舍人弘静夏夜寓直思闻雅琴见寄 · 鲍溶","name":"窃览都官李郎中和李舍人益酬张舍人弘静夏夜寓直思闻雅琴见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝草天子奏，夜语思忧琴。\n因声含香气，其韵流水音。\n仙乐朱凤意，灵芝紫鸾心。\n翻然远求友，岂独双归林。\n松吹暑中冷，星花池上深。\n倘俾有声乐，请以丝和金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26023.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26023","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}